graph TD
    A[FastAPI application] --> B{Incoming request}
    
    B -- GET / --> C[Return API running message]
    B -- POST /api/analyze --> D[Receive uploaded log file]
    
    D --> E[Read and decode UTF-8 contents]
    E --> F[Split log text into lines]
    
    F --> G{More lines to process}
    G -- Yes --> H[Match line against log regex]
    
    H -- No match --> G
    H -- Match found --> I[Extract fields and append parsed log]
    I --> G
    
    G -- No --> J{Any parsed logs}
    J -- No --> K[Return invalid format error]
    
    J -- Yes --> L[Create Pandas DataFrame]
    
    L --> M[Filter status code 401]
    L --> N[Calculate top five IP addresses]
    L --> O[Count HTTP status codes]
    
    M --> P[Count unauthorized requests by IP]
    P --> Q{Requests from IP are at least 3}
    
    Q -- Yes --> R[Create brute force alerts]
    Q -- No --> S[No brute force alert for IP]
    
    R --> T[Return analysis results]
    S --> T
    N --> T
    O --> T